bels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/deployments","created_at":"2015-04-13T18:04:58Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T14:39:15Z","pushed_at":"2026-10-29T14:43:56Z","git_url":"git://github.com/apache/airflow.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:apache/airflow.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow","homepage":"https://airflow.apache.org/","size":790917,"stargazers_count":47308,"watchers_count":47308,"language":"Python","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":18214,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":1927,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["airflow","apache","apache-airflow","automation","dag","data-engineering","data-integration","data-orchestrator","data-pipelines","data-science","elt","etl","machine-learning","mlops","orchestration","python","scheduler","workflow","workflow-engine","workflow-orchestration"],"visibility":"public","forks":18214,"open_issues":1927,"watchers":47308,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/pulls/73963","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/73963","diff_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/73963.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/73963.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-01T11:40:34Z"},"body":"## Why\r\n\r\n`go-sdk/pkg/execution/genmodels/models.gen.go` is generated from the supervisor wire-schema\r\nsnapshot the Python Task SDK owns, and it had fallen two fields behind it. The snapshot moved\r\nin #73224 and #73027; the models were last regenerated in #73531, before both.\r\n\r\nNothing failed, which is the problem: msgpack drops a field the struct does not declare, so\r\nthe supervisor sent `multi_team` and `retry_reason` and the Go SDK could not see them. The\r\nonly thing watching was `TestSupervisorSchemaVersionMatchesSnapshot`, and a snapshot can grow\r\na property without `api_version` moving — which is exactly what happened.\r\n\r\nThe Dag specs had the same exposure and got a check for it in #73936. Making that check cover\r\nboth generated surfaces is what keeps this from happening again.\r\n\r\ncloses: #73954\r\n\r\n## What\r\n\r\n`models.gen.go` regenerated: `TIRunContext.MultiTeam` and `TaskState.RetryReason` are added,\r\nnothing is removed, and the rest of the diff is go-jsonschema reordering its type\r\ndeclarations.\r\n\r\n`scripts/ci/prek/check_go_sdk_spec_drift.py` becomes\r\n`scripts/ci/prek/check_go_sdk_generated_drift.py` and takes a table of targets instead of one\r\nhard-coded path — the Dag specs and the coordinator-protocol models — regenerating each and\r\nasking Git whether the committed files changed. Each target names the schema it generates from\r\nand what to weigh before committing: for the specs, the exclusion list in\r\n`internal/genspec/authoring.go`; for the models, nothing, since nothing is excluded from them.\r\nThe hook (`check-go-sdk-generated-drift`) watches both schemas and both generators.\r\n\r\n`go-sdk/README.md` no longer says the version-constant test makes a prek hook unnecessary,\r\nsince that test is what missed this.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n##### Was generative AI tooling used to co-author this PR?\r\n\r\n- [X] Yes — Claude Code (Opus 5)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/73963/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/73963/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":32247179535,"node_id":"REFE_lADOAgUK288AAAABUI0p488AAAAHghTpDw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/events/32247179535","actor":{"login":"jason810496","id":68415893,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4NDE1ODkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68415893?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason810496","html_url":"https://github.com/jason810496","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason810496/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason810496/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason810496/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason810496/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason810496/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason810496/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason810496/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason810496/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason810496/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"e6a9de5d8326f0314618fe80972537739c5d4a69","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/commits/e6a9de5d8326f0314618fe80972537739c5d4a69","created_at":"2026-10-01T11:40:36Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":32247179676,"node_id":"CE_lADOAgUK288AAAABUI0p488AAAAHghTpnA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/events/32247179676","actor":{"login":"jason810496","id":68415893,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4NDE1ODkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68415893?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason810496","html_url":"https://github.com/jason810496","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason810496/fol